# Marketing website (univ.talkhangyul.com). Copy to .env.local for local development; .env*.local is never committed.
# Every value here is public client-side configuration. Production values live in the Vercel project, not in git.

# Channel Talk (channel.io) public plugin key: the same Hangyul workspace as talkhangyul.com.
# Empty or unset: the chat widget is not loaded and the rest of the site works normally.
VITE_CHANNEL_IO_KEY=
